; Its windup is the longest telegraph any enemy has, and a pad is the fastest answer in the game to a
; committed charge: the pairing is the floor teaching that a migration is a defensive option and not
; only a route.
;
; Difficulty two rather than the three it was authored at, which is a correction made by measuring
; before anybody played it. At three it was absent from 16.8% of generated floors — only about 2.4 of
; a floor's six combat rooms reach difficulty three, so a third-tier entry is competing for a slice
; of the floor rather than for the floor. That is precisely the Data Center's fault repeated: the two
; enemies that floor was built to introduce were missing from a fifth of its floors and nobody could
; have reported it.
weight = 1.1
min_difficulty = 2
